Identify the memory leak:
```c
void process() {
    char* buffer = malloc(1024);
    read_data(buffer);
    printf("%s", buffer);
}  // function returns
```

What's wrong with:
```c
char* p = malloc(100);
free(p);
free(p);  // second free
```

Identify the bug:
```c
char* get_string() {
    char str[] = "hello";
    return str;
}
```

What's wrong with:
```c
char buffer[10];
strcpy(buffer, "This string is way too long");
```

